    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest across a mystical desert to reach the legendary Mount Qaf. Inspired by 1001 Nights, classic adventure titles such as prince of Persia, and rich oriental folklore, this action-adventure game challenges you to scale ancient ruins, solve intricate puzzles, and battle formidable foes\u2014all to save a loved one. Uncover hidden secrets in lost temples and relics as you shape your destiny in a world where every crumbling monument holds a timeless tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Glimpse of Mount Qaf</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pause. Breathe. Begin.</i><br>Mount Qaf isn\u2019t just a place \u2014 it\u2019s a feeling. A surreal, tranquil world steeped in mystery, waiting for you to uncover its secrets. Every vista tells a story; every moment invites exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Balance, Bravery &amp; Beyond</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every step counts.</i><br>Tiptoe across crumbling beams. Hang from ledges high above the abyss. Adventure lives in the little details \u2014 and every ledge, swing, and tightrope walk is part of the thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest across a mystical desert to reach the legendary Mount Qaf. Inspired by 1001 Nights, classic adventure titles such as prince of Persia, and rich oriental folklore, this action-adventure game challenges you to scale ancient ruins, solve intricate puzzles, and battle formidable foes\u2014all to save a loved one. Uncover hidden secrets in lost temples and relics as you shape your destiny in a world where every crumbling monument holds a timeless tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Glimpse of Mount Qaf</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pause. Breathe. Begin.</i><br>Mount Qaf isn\u2019t just a place \u2014 it\u2019s a feeling. A surreal, tranquil world steeped in mystery, waiting for you to uncover its secrets. Every vista tells a story; every moment invites exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Balance, Bravery &amp; Beyond</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every step counts.</i><br>Tiptoe across crumbling beams. Hang from ledges high above the abyss. Adventure lives in the little details \u2014 and every ledge, swing, and tightrope walk is part of the thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.poster.avif?t=1749571259\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.webm?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.mp4?t=1749571259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
